@startuml Update
autonumber

actor "Admin (Superuser)" as Admin
participant "Backend API (Node.js)" as API
database "Central DB (MySQL)" as DB
actor "User" as User
participant "Client (Avalonia UI)" as UI
database "Local DB (SQLite)" as LocalDB

== Admin Updates Global Database ==
Admin -> API : POST/PUT /api/admin/cocktails\n[JWT: Role=ADMIN]
API -> API : Validate Admin Role
API -> DB : Insert/Update Cocktail\n(Set new updatedAt timestamp)
DB --> API : Success
API --> Admin : 200 OK (Record Updated)

== Client Synchronization ==
User -> UI : Open App / Login
UI -> LocalDB : Retrieve lastSyncTimestamp (T1)
LocalDB --> UI : T1

UI -> API : GET /api/sync?since=T1\n[JWT: Role=USER]
API -> DB : SELECT Cocktails, Ingredients\nWHERE updatedAt > T1
DB --> API : Return updated/new records
API --> UI : 200 OK (JSON with delta updates)

UI -> LocalDB : Apply updates (Upsert records)
UI -> LocalDB : Update lastSyncTimestamp (T2)

opt If ingredients or cocktails changed
    UI -> UI : Trigger My Bar Calculation Engine
end

UI --> User : Dashboard ready with latest public data
@enduml